---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Outreach">
    <!-- HERO / HEADER -->
    <section>
        <div class="overlay">
            <h1>Outreach</h1>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TEAM CONNECTIONS -->
    <section class="angled">
        <h2>Team Connections</h2>
        <p>
            During our Rookie year, Orion | NorthStarRobotics was a mentee team
            within the Global Mentorship Program where we were introduced to two
            teams: <strong>#1574 MisCar</strong> and <strong
                >#19176 Broboti</strong
            >. They mentored us in robotic aspects while we helped provide them
            with outreach opportunities. This upcoming season, we plan to act as
            a mentor team for business‑related aspects and cannot wait to expand
            our connections with the GMP!
        </p>

        <br />

        <p>
            We also connected with another local FTC team,
            <strong>#30458 The Masterminds</strong>. Through this opportunity,
            we supported them with their portfolio and judging presentation.
        </p>

        <br />

        <p>
            We also hold connections through multiple homeschool co‑ops
            throughout central Indiana where we recruit members from.
        </p>
    </section>

    <!-- OUTREACH EVENTS PAST -->
    <section class="angled">
        <h2>Outreach Events — Past</h2>

        <img src="/yes-because-no/masiuk-sage-bryce-ryker.png" width="30%" />

        <p>
            Throughout the FIRST Age Season, both students and mentors dedicated
            time to volunteering at the following FLLC and FTC events:
        </p>

        <p>
            UIndy FLLC QT (11/22/25) <br />
            Westfield FTC QT (12/06/25) <br />
            UIndy FLLC States (01/18/26)
        </p>

        <br />

        <img src="/yes-because-no/bryce-abbey-sage-mrscastle.png" width="30%" />

        <p>
            Two of our students hold leadership positions in the FRC scouting
            alliance that 28 FRC teams across Indiana participate in! Through
            this, we have been able to provide a valuable service to the FRC
            community in addition to both FLLC and FTC.
        </p>

        <br />

        <p>
            During the FIRST Age Season, we volunteered <strong
                >157 hours</strong
            >
            with four student team members. This means that
            <strong>31% of our team</strong> participated in Outreach during our Rookie
            Season.
        </p>
    </section>

    <!-- OUTREACH EVENTS PRESENT -->
    <section class="angled">
        <h2>Outreach Events — Present</h2>

        <img src="/yes-because-no/KERCarmelFest.jpg" width="30%" />

        <p>
            While we still maintain our connections with all of our past
            outreach events, we have added another partner:
            <strong>KidsExploreRobotics</strong>, one of our largest outreach
            partners.
        </p>

        <br />

        <p>
            For the current season, our members have logged
            <strong>152 hours</strong> (96.8% of last season’s!) and
            <strong>67% of our team members</strong> have contributed as volunteers.
            We are continuing to look for more outreach opportunities and are excited
            for our future growth.
        </p>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
